+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site ID to select a kitchen; it defaults to `main`.
+An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Stock, batches,
+cooking, alerts and stock-takes use the selected site. Items, suppliers,
+recipes and dishes are shared.
